1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,132
这是云上一台全新的虚拟机
Here's a fresh virtual machine in the cloud:

2
00:00:03,132 --> 00:00:06,763
没有我们代码的副本，没有虚拟环境，没有 uv
no copy of our code, no virtual environment, no uv.

3
00:00:07,083 --> 00:00:09,835
它只有 Docker，我们只输入一条命令
It has only Docker, and we type one command.

4
00:00:10,155 --> 00:00:12,629
先看就好；最后你会自己跑一遍
Just watch; you'll run it yourself at the end.

5
00:00:12,867 --> 00:00:15,593
Docker 下载了一个 image，一共 7 层
Docker downloads an image, in seven layers,

6
00:00:15,593 --> 00:00:17,432
然后在里面启动一个 shell
and starts a shell inside it.

7
00:00:17,752 --> 00:00:19,252
我们在里面运行这个应用
There we run the app,

8
00:00:19,252 --> 00:00:22,701
它的默认文本 I love cheese 翻成了意大利语
and its default text, I love cheese, comes back in Italian.

9
00:00:22,950 --> 00:00:26,619
额外检查一下，README 里没有这一步：这是哪个 Python？
One extra check, not in the README: which Python is this?

10
00:00:26,939 --> 00:00:28,902
是 3.14.7
It's 3.14.7.

11
00:00:29,222 --> 00:00:33,190
可这个 image 的配方是从 Python 3.12 开始的
Yet the recipe for this image starts from Python 3.12.

12
00:00:33,510 --> 00:00:36,113
先记住这个问题；今天我们会分两次解开它
Hold that thought; we'll solve it twice today.

13
00:00:36,350 --> 00:00:39,614
今天的教程 simple-translate 就在这里收尾
That's where today's tutorial, simple-translate, ends.

14
00:00:39,934 --> 00:00:45,865
上节课我们爬了它的前两级：先在 VM 上手动安装，再用 uv
Last lecture we climbed its first two rungs: a manual install on a VM, then uv.

15
00:00:46,185 --> 00:00:51,158
今天爬另外两级：在笔记本上把应用打包成一个 Docker image
Today, the other two: package the app as a Docker image on your laptop,

16
00:00:51,158 --> 00:00:54,099
push 到 Docker Hub，再在 VM 上运行它
push it to Docker Hub, and run it on a VM.

17
00:00:54,333 --> 00:00:57,576
想跟着做的话，把 README 打开，放在视频旁边
To follow along, open the README beside this video.

18
00:00:57,896 --> 00:01:00,846
左上角的三个进度条显示我们在哪儿
Three trackers, top left, show where we are:

19
00:01:00,846 --> 00:01:03,528
在笔记本上，在 Docker Hub 上，还是在 VM 上
on the laptop, on Docker Hub, on the VM.

20
00:01:03,848 --> 00:01:08,077
看到黄色的 your turn 标签，就暂停，自己跑这条命令
When the yellow your-turn tag appears, pause and run the command;

21
00:01:08,077 --> 00:01:11,720
灰色的 extra 标签表示这个检查 README 里没有
a gray extra tag marks a check that isn't in the README.

22
00:01:11,967 --> 00:01:15,777
你需要运行中的 Docker Desktop、一个免费的 Docker Hub 账号
You need Docker Desktop running, a free Docker Hub account,

23
00:01:15,777 --> 00:01:19,135
还有你的 Google Cloud 项目，最后开 VM 要用
and your Google Cloud project for the VM at the end.

24
00:01:19,455 --> 00:01:21,652
今天不需要服务账号，也不需要密钥
No service account or keys today.

25
00:01:22,700 --> 00:01:24,983
先来看贯穿整节课的四个词
First, four words for the whole lecture.

26
00:01:25,303 --> 00:01:28,817
在第 1 讲里，每台新 VM 都要把同样的配置再做一遍
In lecture 1, every new VM needed the same setup,

27
00:01:28,817 --> 00:01:32,044
而且是在一个得配合才行的操作系统上
on an operating system that had to cooperate.

28
00:01:32,364 --> 00:01:36,212
Docker image 把这些全装进一个能复制的东西
A Docker image packs it all into one thing you can copy:

29
00:01:36,212 --> 00:01:39,511
系统文件、Python、各种包和代码
system files, Python, the packages and the code.

30
00:01:39,750 --> 00:01:42,459
一个 image 就是一叠只读层
An image is a stack of read-only layers.

31
00:01:42,779 --> 00:01:46,961
每一层放的是某个构建步骤新增或改动的文件
Each layer holds the files added or changed by one build step.

32
00:01:47,281 --> 00:01:49,581
旁边还有一张小小的配置卡片
Beside it sits a small config card:

33
00:01:49,581 --> 00:01:53,787
放环境变量这类设置，还有要启动哪个程序
settings like environment variables, and which program to start.

34
00:01:54,033 --> 00:01:57,830
配方就是 Dockerfile，Docker 一次读一条指令
The recipe is a Dockerfile, read one instruction at a time.

35
00:01:58,150 --> 00:02:02,161
会改文件的指令，比如 RUN 和 COPY，会加一层
Instructions that change files, like RUN and COPY, add a layer.

36
00:02:02,481 --> 00:02:05,425
别的指令，比如 CMD，只写在卡片上
Others, like CMD, only write on the card.

37
00:02:05,667 --> 00:02:08,175
运行一个 image，就得到一个 container
Run an image and you get a container:

38
00:02:08,175 --> 00:02:13,667
共用同样那几层，最上面再加一层薄薄的可写层，外加一个主进程
the same layers, shared, plus a thin writable layer on top, and one main process.

39
00:02:13,987 --> 00:02:17,315
进程结束，container 就停了
When that process ends, the container stops,

40
00:02:17,315 --> 00:02:20,643
而 --rm 会把它删掉，连同可写层一起
and --rm deletes it, writable layer and all.

41
00:02:20,963 --> 00:02:22,755
而 image 从来不变
The image never changes.

42
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:26,883
可以把 image 想成一个类，每个 container 就是一个实例
Think of the image as a class, and each container as an instance.

43
00:02:27,203 --> 00:02:31,171
README 里有一个小疏漏：它说要构建 docker container
One small slip in the README: it says build the docker container.

44
00:02:31,491 --> 00:02:34,563
构建得到的是 image；运行得到的才是 container
Building makes an image; running makes a container.

45
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:39,173
像 Docker Hub 这样的 registry，按名字把 image 存在货架上
A registry, like Docker Hub, stores images by name, on shelves.

46
00:02:39,493 --> 00:02:42,971
所谓 tag，就是指向某一个 image 的名字，比如 latest
A tag is a name that points at one image, such as latest.

47
00:02:43,217 --> 00:02:45,670
而且，container 不是一台小 VM
And a container is not a small VM.

48
00:02:45,990 --> 00:02:50,065
VM 会启动自己的内核，也就是操作系统的核心
A VM boots its own kernel, the core of the operating system.

49
00:02:50,385 --> 00:02:54,587
而 container 是一些相互隔离的进程，共用同一个 Linux 内核
Containers are isolated processes that share one Linux kernel.

50
00:02:54,983 --> 00:02:56,822
在 Mac 或 Windows 笔记本上
On a Mac or Windows laptop,

51
00:02:56,822 --> 00:03:01,319
Docker Desktop 靠一台隐藏的小 Linux VM，来提供这个内核
Docker Desktop provides that kernel with a small, hidden Linux VM.

52
00:03:01,639 --> 00:03:05,671
在云上的 VM 里，Docker 直接跑在 VM 自己的 Linux 上
On a cloud VM, Docker runs right on the VM's own Linux.

53
00:03:05,917 --> 00:03:11,194
第 1 讲里 venv 隔离不了的东西，也就是系统文件和库
What a venv couldn't isolate in lecture 1, the system's files and libraries,

54
00:03:11,194 --> 00:03:12,794
现在都装进了盒子里
is now inside the box.

55
00:03:13,042 --> 00:03:15,666
GPU 驱动还是来自宿主机
GPU drivers still come from the host.

56
00:03:16,900 --> 00:03:18,509
现在进入 README 的这一节
Now the README section Developing App using Containers.

57
00:03:18,509 --> 00:03:20,676
Developing App using Containers
Now the README section Developing App using Containers.

58
00:03:20,996 --> 00:03:23,044
在你的笔记本上打开一个终端
Open a terminal on your laptop.

59
00:03:23,364 --> 00:03:26,152
在 Mac 上，你的提示符会不一样
On a Mac your prompt looks different;

60
00:03:26,152 --> 00:03:30,297
在 Windows 上，用 WSL 里的 Ubuntu 终端，或者 Git Bash
on Windows, use an Ubuntu terminal in WSL, or Git Bash.

61
00:03:30,617 --> 00:03:34,106
在 Git Bash 里，docker run 前面要加上 winpty
In Git Bash, put winpty in front of docker run

62
00:03:34,106 --> 00:03:36,761
如果它报 stdin is not a terminal 的话
if it says stdin is not a terminal.

63
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:40,392
首先，docker container ls 列出正在运行的 container
First, docker container ls lists running containers.

64
00:03:40,712 --> 00:03:43,677
这里只显示了表头，所以什么都没在运行
Here it shows only the header, so nothing is running.

65
00:03:43,997 --> 00:03:46,706
如果你那边连不上 Docker daemon
If yours can't connect to the Docker daemon,

66
00:03:46,706 --> 00:03:48,861
就启动 Docker Desktop 再试
start Docker Desktop and try again.

67
00:03:49,181 --> 00:03:50,533
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

68
00:03:50,583 --> 00:03:52,844
接着，停掉所有正在运行的 container
Next, stop any running container.

69
00:03:53,164 --> 00:03:57,794
这里没有要停的；如果你有，docker stop 加上它的 ID 就行
There's nothing to stop here; if you have one, docker stop with its ID does it.

70
00:03:58,033 --> 00:03:59,700
然后是 docker system prune
Then docker system prune.

71
00:03:59,996 --> 00:04:02,982
它会列出要删掉的东西，再问你；输入 y
It lists what it will remove and asks; type y.

72
00:04:03,302 --> 00:04:04,878
这里没有空间可回收
Nothing to reclaim here;

73
00:04:04,878 --> 00:04:07,925
你那边可能会删掉一个停了的 hello-world container
yours may delete the stopped hello-world container

74
00:04:07,925 --> 00:04:09,482
是 Tutorial 0 留下的
from Tutorial 0.

75
00:04:09,532 --> 00:04:10,883
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

76
00:04:10,933 --> 00:04:14,944
看第三项：dangling images，也就是没有名字的 image
Look at the third item: dangling images, the ones without a name.

77
00:04:15,264 --> 00:04:18,403
别看 README 的标题那么写，有名字的 image 其实会留下来
Despite the README's heading, named images survive.

78
00:04:18,720 --> 00:04:22,027
加上 -a 的话，prune 会删掉所有没在用的 image
With -a, prune would remove every unused image.

79
00:04:22,267 --> 00:04:25,104
然后，docker image ls 列出你的 image
Then docker image ls lists your images.

80
00:04:25,424 --> 00:04:26,868
这里列表是空的
The list is empty here;

81
00:04:26,868 --> 00:04:30,886
你那边可能还会显示 hello-world：它有名字，所以留了下来
yours may still show hello-world: it has a name, so it survived.

82
00:04:31,206 --> 00:04:36,112
你看到的列可能不一样：这是录制时的 Docker 29
Your columns may differ: this is Docker 29, at the time of recording.

83
00:04:36,350 --> 00:04:37,687
接下来是代码
Now the code.

84
00:04:37,737 --> 00:04:42,249
README 也提醒了，上节课在 VM 上 clone 的那份帮不上忙
As the README notes, a clone on last lecture's VM doesn't help:

85
00:04:42,249 --> 00:04:44,755
Docker Desktop 跑在你的笔记本上
Docker Desktop runs on your laptop.

86
00:04:45,075 --> 00:04:48,019
在这里 clone，然后 cd 进 simple-translate
Clone it here, then cd into simple-translate.

87
00:04:48,339 --> 00:04:49,833
暂停一下，两条都跑一遍
Pause and run both.

88
00:04:49,883 --> 00:04:53,104
额外检查一下，README 里没有这一步：ls -a
An extra check, not in the README: ls -a.

89
00:04:53,424 --> 00:04:56,447
参考答案 Dockerfile.txt 在这儿
There's the solution, Dockerfile.txt,

90
00:04:56,447 --> 00:05:00,614
但没有一个就叫 Dockerfile 的文件，也没有 uv.lock
but no file called just Dockerfile, and no uv.lock.

91
00:05:00,850 --> 00:05:04,060
现在就跑一下 README 里的构建命令，这是额外的一步
Run the README's build command now, as an extra:

92
00:05:04,060 --> 00:05:05,799
报 failed to read dockerfile
failed to read dockerfile.

93
00:05:06,119 --> 00:05:08,850
README 是要你自己写这个文件，分五步
The README wants you to write it, in five steps.

94
00:05:09,900 --> 00:05:12,783
接下来，在 simple-translate 目录里
Next, inside the simple-translate folder,

95
00:05:12,783 --> 00:05:16,791
建一个叫 Dockerfile 的文件：大写 D，没有扩展名
create a file called Dockerfile: capital D, no extension.

96
00:05:17,111 --> 00:05:21,420
README 分五步把它填满，每一步之后都构建一次、运行一次
The README fills it in five steps, with a build and a run after each.

97
00:05:21,740 --> 00:05:23,383
暂停一下，把文件建好
Pause and create the file.

98
00:05:23,617 --> 00:05:26,740
Dockerfile 的第 1 步只有一条指令
Dockerfile step 1 is one instruction:

99
00:05:26,740 --> 00:05:29,356
FROM python:3.12-slim-bookworm
FROM python:3.12-slim-bookworm.

100
00:05:29,676 --> 00:05:31,829
这是官方的 Python image
That's the official Python image,

101
00:05:31,829 --> 00:05:34,177
基于精简版的 Debian 12，代号 bookworm
on a slim Debian 12 called bookworm.

102
00:05:34,497 --> 00:05:37,441
粘贴进去，保存，再用 cat 检查一下，这是额外的一步
Paste it in, save, and check with cat, an extra.

103
00:05:37,683 --> 00:05:39,283
接下来是构建命令
Now the build command.

104
00:05:39,368 --> 00:05:43,976
参数 -t 给 image 取名 simple-translate；-f 指定配方
-t names the image simple-translate; -f picks the recipe.

105
00:05:44,296 --> 00:05:47,599
末尾那个点就是构建上下文，也就是这个目录
And the final dot is the build context: this folder,

106
00:05:47,599 --> 00:05:49,758
Docker 会把它发给构建器
which Docker sends to the builder.

107
00:05:50,078 --> 00:05:52,083
第 3 步会说明这为什么重要
Step 3 shows why that matters.

108
00:05:52,333 --> 00:05:53,933
暂停一下，跑一下构建
Pause and run the build.

109
00:05:54,146 --> 00:05:56,216
你的终端显示的是精简视图
Your terminal shows a compact view.

110
00:05:56,536 --> 00:05:58,697
这里看到的是完整日志
Here you see the full log;

111
00:05:58,697 --> 00:06:01,357
要看到它，就加上 --progress 参数，设成 plain
to get it, add --progress=plain.

112
00:06:01,677 --> 00:06:03,177
在 Docker Desktop 上
On Docker Desktop,

113
00:06:03,177 --> 00:06:06,307
构建器叫 desktop-linux，不叫 default
the builder is called desktop-linux, not default.

114
00:06:06,550 --> 00:06:11,614
Docker 下载了 base image：4 层，压缩后不到 50 MB
Docker fetches the base image, four layers, under 50 megabytes compressed,

115
00:06:11,614 --> 00:06:15,446
然后把结果存为 simple-translate，tag 是 latest
and saves the result as simple-translate, tagged latest.

116
00:06:15,766 --> 00:06:18,262
这 4 层就是我们这叠层的最底部
Those four layers are the bottom of our stack.

117
00:06:18,500 --> 00:06:20,100
它启动的时候会做什么？
What will it do when it starts?

118
00:06:20,420 --> 00:06:24,234
额外用 docker image inspect 读一下配置卡片
An extra docker image inspect reads the config card:

119
00:06:24,234 --> 00:06:25,627
没有 ENTRYPOINT
no entrypoint,

120
00:06:25,627 --> 00:06:29,295
CMD 是 python3，是从 base image 继承来的
and the command python3, inherited from the base image.

121
00:06:29,615 --> 00:06:31,548
所以我们预测会出现 Python 提示符
So we predict a Python prompt.

122
00:06:31,733 --> 00:06:37,450
现在是运行命令：docker run --rm -ti simple-translate
Now the run command: docker run --rm -ti simple-translate.

123
00:06:37,770 --> 00:06:42,656
其中 --rm 负责事后清理；-ti 让你能往里面输入
--rm cleans up afterwards; -ti lets you type into it.

124
00:06:42,976 --> 00:06:44,398
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

125
00:06:44,448 --> 00:06:48,864
Python 提示符出来了，录制时是 3.12.15
There's the Python prompt, 3.12.15 at the time of recording.

126
00:06:49,184 --> 00:06:51,445
输入带括号的 exit 退出
Type exit() to leave.

127
00:06:51,683 --> 00:06:54,153
有个意外：额外用 git status 看一下
One surprise: an extra git status says

128
00:06:54,153 --> 00:06:57,144
显示 nothing to commit，可我们刚建了一个文件
nothing to commit, though we just made a file.

129
00:06:57,464 --> 00:07:00,603
这里的 .gitignore 文件第 3 行写着 Dockerfile
The .gitignore file here lists Dockerfile on line 3,

130
00:07:00,603 --> 00:07:02,203
所以 git 把你的忽略了
so git hides yours.

131
00:07:02,371 --> 00:07:05,081
想照样 commit 它，就用 git add -f
To commit it anyway, use git add -f.

132
00:07:06,117 --> 00:07:10,213
第 2 步加一行：ENTRYPOINT /bin/bash
Step 2 adds one line: ENTRYPOINT /bin/bash.

133
00:07:10,533 --> 00:07:12,581
放在 FROM 那一行下面，保存
Put it under the FROM line, and save.

134
00:07:12,817 --> 00:07:14,417
暂停一下，再构建一次
Pause and build again.

135
00:07:14,524 --> 00:07:19,004
FROM 那一步显示 CACHED：什么都没下载，也没有加层
The FROM step says CACHED: nothing is downloaded, and no layer is added.

136
00:07:19,324 --> 00:07:22,118
ENTRYPOINT 只写在配置卡片上
ENTRYPOINT only writes on the config card.

137
00:07:22,367 --> 00:07:25,548
可以把 ENTRYPOINT 想成要启动的程序
Think of ENTRYPOINT as the program to start,

138
00:07:25,548 --> 00:07:27,935
把 CMD 想成它的默认参数
and CMD as its default arguments.

139
00:07:28,255 --> 00:07:32,714
现在 ENTRYPOINT 是 bash，而 CMD 那一格还写着 python3
The entrypoint is now bash, and the command slot still says python3.

140
00:07:33,034 --> 00:07:36,212
那么 container 会启动 bash，再让它运行 python3 吗？
So will the container start bash, running python3?

141
00:07:36,450 --> 00:07:38,265
这个额外的 inspect 说不会
This extra inspect says no:

142
00:07:38,265 --> 00:07:41,762
ENTRYPOINT 是 bash，CMD 现在是 null
the entrypoint is bash, and the command is now null.

143
00:07:42,082 --> 00:07:46,541
一设置 ENTRYPOINT，从 base image 继承来的 CMD 就被清空了
Setting an entrypoint resets the command you inherited from the base image.

144
00:07:46,861 --> 00:07:48,568
所以启动的就只有 bash 本身
So bash starts on its own.

145
00:07:48,817 --> 00:07:51,372
暂停一下，自己跑一遍：只有一个光秃秃的提示符
Pause and run it: a bare prompt.

146
00:07:51,422 --> 00:07:52,863
从左往右读
Read it left to right.

147
00:07:52,913 --> 00:07:55,985
你是 root，也就是 container 里的管理员
You're root, the administrator, inside the container.

148
00:07:56,305 --> 00:07:59,237
@ 符号后面是 container 的 ID
After the @ sign comes the container's ID,

149
00:07:59,237 --> 00:08:02,449
每次运行都不一样，所以你的会不同
which changes every run, so yours will differ.

150
00:08:02,684 --> 00:08:06,452
而那个斜杠表示你从 image 的根目录开始
And the slash means you start in the top folder of the image,

151
00:08:06,452 --> 00:08:09,233
因为这个 image 没有设置工作目录
because this image sets no working directory.

152
00:08:09,553 --> 00:08:11,153
输入 exit 退出
Type exit to leave.

153
00:08:11,983 --> 00:08:14,031
第 3 步加两条指令
Step 3 adds two instructions.

154
00:08:14,351 --> 00:08:19,407
RUN pip install uv：用 base image 自带的 pip 来装 uv
RUN pip install uv uses the pip of the base image to install uv.

155
00:08:19,727 --> 00:08:22,785
而 COPY 那一行把这个目录，也就是那个点
And the COPY line copies this folder, .,

156
00:08:22,785 --> 00:08:25,231
复制到 image 的根目录，也就是点斜杠
into the image's top folder, ./.

157
00:08:25,551 --> 00:08:27,471
两行都加在末尾，保存
Add both at the end, and save.

158
00:08:27,716 --> 00:08:29,849
末尾那个点为什么重要，原因在这儿
Here's why the final dot matters.

159
00:08:30,169 --> 00:08:36,036
Docker 把整个目录打成一个包裹，也就是构建上下文，发给构建器
Docker packs the whole folder into one parcel, the build context, and sends it to the builder.

160
00:08:36,356 --> 00:08:37,655
每个文件都会进去
Every file goes in,

161
00:08:37,655 --> 00:08:40,800
隐藏的 .git 目录和你的 Dockerfile 也不例外
the hidden git folder and your Dockerfile too;

162
00:08:40,800 --> 00:08:44,149
一个 .dockerignore 文件可以排除一些文件
a file called .dockerignore could leave some out,

163
00:08:44,149 --> 00:08:45,749
但这个 repo 里没有
but this repo has none.

164
00:08:46,041 --> 00:08:49,604
COPY 那一行把它全部拆开，放进 image 的根目录
The COPY line unpacks it all into the image's top folder.

165
00:08:49,850 --> 00:08:51,293
暂停一下，构建一次
Pause and build.

166
00:08:51,343 --> 00:08:54,866
日志也证实了：没有 .dockerignore 文件
The log confirms it: there's no .dockerignore file,

167
00:08:54,866 --> 00:08:58,319
所以什么都没被过滤掉，整个构建上下文
so nothing is filtered out, and the whole context,

168
00:08:58,319 --> 00:09:01,220
这里是 63 KB，都传给了构建器
63 kilobytes here, travels to the builder.

169
00:09:01,466 --> 00:09:07,044
接着 pip 装了 uv，录制时是 0.13.0 版
Then pip installs uv, version 0.13.0 at the time of recording,

170
00:09:07,044 --> 00:09:09,743
然后 COPY 运行：多了两个新层
and COPY runs: two new layers.

171
00:09:10,063 --> 00:09:12,410
另外，pip 还警告说不该用 root 运行
Pip also warns about running as root.

172
00:09:12,730 --> 00:09:15,150
在第 1 讲里这个警告很重要
In lecture 1 that warning mattered;

173
00:09:15,150 --> 00:09:17,914
在这里，image 本身就起到了隔离的作用
here, the image itself is the isolation.

174
00:09:18,933 --> 00:09:23,306
来想一个问题：uv 装好了，代码也进了 image
Something to ponder: uv is installed, and the code is in the image.

175
00:09:23,626 --> 00:09:25,802
那 python cli.py 能跑起来吗？
Will python cli.py run?

176
00:09:32,650 --> 00:09:36,591
不能。暂停一下，自己跑一遍，然后用 ls 四处看看
No. Pause and run it, then look around with ls,

177
00:09:36,591 --> 00:09:40,863
这是额外的一步：我们的文件就挨着系统自己的目录
an extra: our files sit right next to the system's own folders.

178
00:09:41,100 --> 00:09:44,162
然后是 python cli.py，又一个额外检查
Then python cli.py, another extra:

179
00:09:44,162 --> 00:09:48,033
报 ModuleNotFoundError，No module named art
ModuleNotFoundError, No module named 'art'.

180
00:09:48,353 --> 00:09:51,169
我们装了装包的工具，却没装包
We installed the installer, not the packages.

181
00:09:51,489 --> 00:09:53,089
输入 exit
Type exit.

182
00:09:54,383 --> 00:09:58,287
第 4 步加上 RUN uv sync；加在末尾，保存
Step 4 adds RUN uv sync; add it at the end, and save.

183
00:09:58,607 --> 00:10:05,647
和上节课在 VM 上一样，它读 pyproject.toml，把包装进 venv
Like on last lecture's VM, it reads pyproject.toml and installs the packages into a venv.

184
00:10:05,883 --> 00:10:07,198
先预测一下
Now predict.

185
00:10:07,248 --> 00:10:10,101
这个 image 的 Python 是 3.12
This image's Python is 3.12,

186
00:10:10,101 --> 00:10:15,398
而 pyproject.toml 第 6 行要求 3.13 及以上
and line 6 of pyproject.toml asks for 3.13 or newer.

187
00:10:15,718 --> 00:10:17,830
构建的时候，uv sync 会做什么？
What will uv sync do during the build?

188
00:10:26,666 --> 00:10:28,109
暂停一下，构建一次
Pause and build.

189
00:10:28,159 --> 00:10:32,110
先注意：pip 那一步是 CACHED，COPY 却是 DONE
First, notice: the pip step says CACHED, but COPY says DONE:

190
00:10:32,110 --> 00:10:35,007
它又跑了一遍，虽然我们只加了一行
it ran again, although we only added a line.

191
00:10:35,327 --> 00:10:37,312
这个问题留到第二部分
Keep that question for part 2.

192
00:10:37,550 --> 00:10:38,993
现在揭晓答案
Now the answer.

193
00:10:39,043 --> 00:10:42,485
和第 1 讲里那台 Debian 12 的 VM 一样
As on the Debian 12 VM in lecture 1,

194
00:10:42,485 --> 00:10:49,177
uv 自己下载了一个 Python：录制时是 CPython 3.15.0
uv downloads its own Python: CPython 3.15.0, at the time of recording.

195
00:10:49,497 --> 00:10:54,382
然后它在 /.venv 建了一个 venv，装了 11 个包
Then it creates a venv at /.venv, and installs 11 packages.

196
00:10:54,616 --> 00:10:58,648
在数轴上，这个要求覆盖 3.13 及以上
On the number line, the requirement covers 3.13 and newer.

197
00:10:58,968 --> 00:11:01,489
而 base image 的 3.12 落在范围外
The base image's 3.12 falls outside,

198
00:11:01,489 --> 00:11:05,901
所以 uv 从它知道的版本里，下载了范围内最新的稳定版 Python
so uv downloads the newest stable Python it knows in the range,

199
00:11:05,901 --> 00:11:08,632
venv 里的 python 就软链接到它
and the python in the venv links to it.

200
00:11:13,600 --> 00:11:16,526
暂停一下，自己跑一遍，再做两个额外检查
Pause and run it, then two extras:

201
00:11:16,526 --> 00:11:21,344
ls -a，它连隐藏文件也会列出来；还有 python cli.py
ls -a, which also lists hidden files, and python cli.py.

202
00:11:21,664 --> 00:11:25,333
现在列表里多了 .venv，还有一个新的 uv.lock
Now the listing shows .venv, and a new uv.lock.

203
00:11:25,653 --> 00:11:29,536
可 python cli.py 还是和之前一样，失败了
But python cli.py fails exactly as before.

204
00:11:29,856 --> 00:11:34,016
为什么？回想一下第 1 讲：激活其实只是改 PATH
Why? Remember lecture 1: activation is just PATH.

205
00:11:34,336 --> 00:11:36,398
没有任何东西激活这个 venv
Nothing has activated the venv,

206
00:11:36,398 --> 00:11:40,387
所以 python 这个词会先找到 /usr/local/bin 里的 Python
so the word python first finds the Python in /usr/local/bin,

207
00:11:40,387 --> 00:11:41,987
它来自 base image
from the base image.

208
00:11:42,037 --> 00:11:45,366
那是 3.12，我们的包它一个都没有
That's 3.12, and it has none of our packages.

209
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:49,792
激活 venv 会把它的 bin 目录放到最前面
Activating the venv would put its bin folder in front,

210
00:11:49,792 --> 00:11:52,043
python 就会找到 3.15.0
and python would find 3.15.0.

211
00:11:52,363 --> 00:11:54,834
两个额外检查证实了这一点
Two extra checks confirm it:

212
00:11:54,834 --> 00:11:58,098
venv 自己的 python 显示版本是 3.15.0
the venv's own python reports 3.15.0,

213
00:11:58,098 --> 00:12:03,392
source 一下 activate 脚本之后，python cli.py 就能跑了
and after sourcing the activate script, python cli.py works.

214
00:12:03,712 --> 00:12:06,080
提示符前面多了带括号的 app
The prompt now shows (app).

215
00:12:06,400 --> 00:12:08,661
输入 exit，回到你的笔记本
Type exit to get back to your laptop.

216
00:12:08,900 --> 00:12:11,686
所以这个 image 里有两个 Python
So this image carries two Pythons:

217
00:12:11,686 --> 00:12:17,092
base image 带的 3.12，只用来装了 uv；还有给应用用的 3.15
3.12 from the base, which only installed uv, and 3.15 for the app.

218
00:12:17,412 --> 00:12:21,487
这解开了开头那个谜题的一半，也是教程里一个小小的不一致
That's half of the opening puzzle, and a small mismatch in the tutorial.

219
00:12:21,807 --> 00:12:25,697
在你自己的项目里，要么从 Python 3.13 的 image 开始
In your own projects, start from a Python 3.13 image,

220
00:12:25,697 --> 00:12:28,633
要么让 requires-python 和 image 对上
or make requires-python match the image.

221
00:12:30,067 --> 00:12:33,224
第 5 步加上最后一条指令：CMD
Step 5 adds the last instruction, CMD.

222
00:12:33,544 --> 00:12:36,100
CMD 包含 -c 和一条带引号的命令
It holds -c and one quoted command:

223
00:12:36,100 --> 00:12:39,240
先 source activate 脚本，再 exec bash
source the activate script, then exec bash.

224
00:12:39,560 --> 00:12:41,224
加在末尾，保存
Add it at the end, and save.

225
00:12:41,467 --> 00:12:46,382
在卡片上，ENTRYPOINT 和 CMD 拼成一条命令行
On the card, the entrypoint and the command join into one command line:

226
00:12:46,382 --> 00:12:48,251
bash、-c，再加上那个字符串
bash, -c, then that string.

227
00:12:48,571 --> 00:12:51,942
单独的 bash -c 会运行这个字符串，然后退出
On its own, bash -c runs the string and exits.

228
00:12:52,184 --> 00:12:55,258
这里的字符串先 source activate 脚本
Here the string first sources the activate script,

229
00:12:55,258 --> 00:12:58,456
它会把 venv 的 bin 目录放到 PATH 的最前面
which puts the bin folder of the venv first in PATH.

230
00:12:58,776 --> 00:13:02,356
接着 exec bash 把这个 bash 换成一个交互式的 bash
Then exec bash swaps this bash for an interactive one that keeps the new PATH and gives you a prompt.

231
00:13:02,356 --> 00:13:04,792
它保留新的 PATH，还给你一个提示符
Then exec bash swaps this bash for an interactive one that keeps the new PATH and gives you a prompt.

232
00:13:05,034 --> 00:13:06,477
暂停一下，构建一次
Pause and build.

233
00:13:06,527 --> 00:13:08,496
COPY 和 uv sync 又跑了一遍
Again COPY and uv sync run,

234
00:13:08,496 --> 00:13:11,925
Python 也重新下载了，只因为加了一行
and Python downloads again, for one added line.

235
00:13:12,245 --> 00:13:13,845
原因第二部分再讲
Part 2 explains why.

236
00:13:14,050 --> 00:13:15,472
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

237
00:13:15,522 --> 00:13:19,127
这次提示符前面没有带括号的 app；venv 激活了吗？
No (app) this time; is the venv active?

238
00:13:19,447 --> 00:13:24,365
这几个额外检查说是：which python 指向 .venv 里面
These extra checks say yes: which python points into .venv,

239
00:13:24,365 --> 00:13:28,450
版本是 3.15.0，virtual env 这个变量也设置好了
it's 3.15.0, and the VIRTUAL_ENV variable is set.

240
00:13:28,770 --> 00:13:30,733
新起的 bash 设置了自己的提示符
The fresh bash set its own prompt.

241
00:13:31,053 --> 00:13:34,225
今天课件里的 run 命令多加了 --entrypoint
The lecture's run command adds --entrypoint,

242
00:13:34,225 --> 00:13:37,325
它会把这个 CMD 连同 venv 一起去掉
which drops this CMD, and the venv with it.

243
00:13:37,645 --> 00:13:40,056
然后输入 exit，回到你的笔记本
Then type exit, back to your laptop.

244
00:13:40,300 --> 00:13:44,396
README 接着给了一个参考答案：Dockerfile.txt 这个文件
The README then points to a solution, Dockerfile.txt.

245
00:13:44,716 --> 00:13:46,968
额外用 diff 看一下它多了什么
An extra diff shows what it adds;

246
00:13:46,968 --> 00:13:50,860
如果你的输出是小于号和大于号，就加上 -u
if yours prints less-than and greater-than signs, add -u.

247
00:13:51,180 --> 00:13:54,926
首先是三行 ENV：让 apt 不再提问
First, three ENV lines: no questions from apt,

248
00:13:54,926 --> 00:13:57,858
用 UTF-8 的 locale，日志不缓冲
a UTF-8 locale, and unbuffered logs.

249
00:13:58,100 --> 00:13:59,717
其次是一条更大的 RUN
Second, one bigger RUN:

250
00:13:59,717 --> 00:14:05,204
更新并升级 Debian 软件包，做清理，升级 pip，再装 uv
update and upgrade the Debian packages, clean up, upgrade pip, and install uv.

251
00:14:05,524 --> 00:14:07,745
还有，ENTRYPOINT 挪到了最后
And ENTRYPOINT moved to the end:

252
00:14:07,745 --> 00:14:11,007
ENTRYPOINT 和 CMD 的顺序无所谓
the order of ENTRYPOINT and CMD doesn't matter.

253
00:14:11,250 --> 00:14:13,298
README 只提到了这个文件名
The README only names the file.

254
00:14:13,618 --> 00:14:16,445
所以最快的办法是这样，一条额外的命令
So here's the quickest way, an extra command:

255
00:14:16,445 --> 00:14:18,695
用 cp 把它复制过来，覆盖你的 Dockerfile
copy it over yours with cp.

256
00:14:19,015 --> 00:14:20,450
暂停一下，照着做
Pause and do that.

257
00:14:20,500 --> 00:14:23,306
现在是 README 的 Build Docker Image 一节
Now the README's Build Docker Image section:

258
00:14:23,306 --> 00:14:26,431
在 simple-translate 目录里，跑同样的构建
from the simple-translate folder, the same build.

259
00:14:26,751 --> 00:14:28,173
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

260
00:14:28,223 --> 00:14:30,542
你看到的会是这样的精简视图
This compact view is what you'll see:

261
00:14:30,542 --> 00:14:33,364
四个构建步骤，apt 和 pip 那一步最慢
four steps, the apt and pip step the slowest.

262
00:14:34,400 --> 00:14:38,402
README 的 Run Docker Container 这一步
Now the README's Run Docker Container step:

263
00:14:38,402 --> 00:14:41,845
docker run --rm -ti simple-translate
docker run --rm -ti simple-translate.

264
00:14:42,165 --> 00:14:44,964
在提示符后面，输入 README 里的翻译
At the prompt, type the README's translation:

265
00:14:44,964 --> 00:14:47,328
Good morning，从英语翻成西班牙语
Good morning, from English to Spanish.

266
00:14:47,648 --> 00:14:49,133
暂停一下，两条都跑一遍
Pause and run both.

267
00:14:49,183 --> 00:14:51,284
Good morning 翻成了西班牙语
Good morning comes back in Spanish:

268
00:14:51,284 --> 00:14:55,967
请求从 container 出发，经过你笔记本的网络，到了 Google
the request went from the container, through your laptop's network, to Google.

269
00:14:56,287 --> 00:14:58,604
如果你那边最后报了运行时错误
If yours ends in a runtime error,

270
00:14:58,604 --> 00:15:01,272
那是 Google 拒绝了请求：过一会儿再试
Google refused the request: try later;

271
00:15:01,272 --> 00:15:02,517
Docker 没问题
Docker is fine.

272
00:15:02,567 --> 00:15:05,703
要离开，输入 exit，就回到你的笔记本上了
To leave, type exit, and you're back on your laptop.

273
00:15:06,023 --> 00:15:07,383
暂停一下，照着做
Pause and do it.

274
00:15:07,433 --> 00:15:09,004
那 exit 做了什么？
What did exit do?

275
00:15:09,054 --> 00:15:11,505
它结束了 container 的进程
It ended the container's process,

276
00:15:11,505 --> 00:15:14,921
所以 container 停了，然后 --rm 把它删掉了
so the container stopped, and --rm deleted it.

277
00:15:15,241 --> 00:15:20,468
额外检查 docker ps -a，会列出所有 container，连停了的也算
An extra check, docker ps -a, lists every container, even stopped ones.

278
00:15:20,788 --> 00:15:23,476
什么都没剩下；image 原封不动
Nothing is left; the image is untouched.

279
00:15:23,717 --> 00:15:29,669
第二次运行时，额外检查 echo $$ 显示 bash 是 1 号进程
In a second run, an extra check, echo $$, shows that bash is process number 1.

280
00:15:29,989 --> 00:15:33,123
这就是今天这节课讲的 PID 命名空间
That's the PID namespace from today's lecture:

281
00:15:33,123 --> 00:15:36,325
每个 container 都从 1 开始给自己的进程编号
each container counts its own processes from 1.

282
00:15:36,645 --> 00:15:39,397
只要这个进程还在，container 就还在
The container lives as long as that process.

283
00:15:39,717 --> 00:15:43,600
参数 -i 接上你的键盘，-t 给它一个终端
-i connects your keyboard, and -t gives it a terminal.

284
00:15:43,920 --> 00:15:45,520
然后输入 exit
Then type exit.

285
00:15:46,517 --> 00:15:47,790
先出个小题
Now a puzzle.

286
00:15:47,840 --> 00:15:51,253
记住，CMD 只放默认参数
Remember, CMD only holds the default arguments.

287
00:15:51,573 --> 00:15:55,023
如果在 image 名后面直接写几个词会怎样
What if you put words right after the image name:

288
00:15:55,023 --> 00:15:58,613
docker run --rm -ti simple-translate python cli.py？
docker run --rm -ti simple-translate python cli.py?

289
00:15:58,933 --> 00:16:01,194
这个 container 会运行哪条命令行？
What command line does the container run?

290
00:16:10,633 --> 00:16:14,814
写在 image 名后面的词会替换 CMD，而且只替换 CMD
Words after the image name replace CMD, and only CMD.

291
00:16:15,134 --> 00:16:18,761
所以 container 运行的是：/bin/bash python cli.py
So the container runs /bin/bash python cli.py.

292
00:16:19,081 --> 00:16:21,376
于是 bash 把 python 当成脚本名
Bash takes python as a script name,

293
00:16:21,376 --> 00:16:24,457
在 /usr/local/bin 里找到了 Python 程序
and finds the Python program in /usr/local/bin.

294
00:16:24,777 --> 00:16:27,781
那是一个二进制文件，所以 bash 拒绝了
That's a binary, so bash refuses:

295
00:16:27,781 --> 00:16:31,604
cannot execute binary file，退出码 126
cannot execute binary file, exit code 126.

296
00:16:31,850 --> 00:16:36,128
想一次就跑完，就用你自己的 -c 字符串替换 CMD
To run it in one go, replace CMD with your own -c string,

297
00:16:36,128 --> 00:16:40,106
像这个额外命令一样：先激活，再翻译成法语
as in this extra: activate, then translate to French.

298
00:16:41,350 --> 00:16:46,313
这个 repo 的辅助脚本 docker-shell.sh 一次就能构建并运行
A repo helper, docker-shell.sh, builds and runs in one go:

299
00:16:46,313 --> 00:16:48,966
跑它的命令是：sh docker-shell.sh
run it with sh docker-shell.sh.

300
00:16:49,200 --> 00:16:51,227
你已经构建并运行了自己的 image
You've built and run your own image.

301
00:16:51,547 --> 00:16:53,421
第二部分讲：image 里有什么
In part 2: what's inside it,

302
00:16:53,421 --> 00:16:56,901
为什么老是重新构建，以及怎么把它送到 VM 上
why it keeps rebuilding, and how to ship it to a VM.
